@startuml Passenger_App_Screen_Flow
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam roundCorner 15
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

title Passenger Mobile App - Screen Flow & Navigation Graph

[1. Main Map Radar View\n(Nearby Drivers & Search Bar)] as S1
[2. Address Autocomplete & Pin Drop] as S2
[3. Tariff Selection & Price Quote Sheet\n(Economy, Comfort, Surge Multiplier)] as S3
[4. Payment Method & Promo Selector] as S4
[5. Radar Searching & Driver Matching Screen\n(Animated Ripple + Cancel Button)] as S5
[6. Driver Assigned & Arriving HUD\n(Car Model, Plate, Pin Code, ETA)] as S6
[7. Active In-Transit Ride View\n(Route Polyline, SOS Pill, Share Trip)] as S7
[8. Ride Completion & Digital Receipt] as S8
[9. Star Rating & Tip Selector] as S9

S1 --> S2 : Tap "Where to?" input
S2 --> S3 : Select destination address
S3 --> S4 : Tap Payment Pill (Optional)
S4 --> S3 : Confirm Card / Apple Pay
S3 --> S5 : Tap "Confirm & Request Ride"
S5 --> S1 : Rider cancels during search
S5 --> S6 : Event: DRIVER_ASSIGNED
S6 --> S7 : Driver starts trip (OTP verified)
S7 --> S8 : Driver completes trip at dropoff
S8 --> S9 : Tap "Rate Trip"
S9 --> S1 : Submit rating & feedback

@enduml
